Step 3 in a full verification (spec §7) is checking the subject: confirm the identifier in the record matches the identifier the subject actually carries — Remote ID serial, N-number, device ID, or content hash. WorthChain attaches to the existing mark; it does not issue a competing identity. A SCITT receipt (RFC 9943 / RFC 9942), where one exists, is checked after the signature — registration is optional in v0.1 and no Transparency Service is chosen yet.
